Description: NAVTEX receiver and web interface
 Background NAVTEX receiver for SDRplay and RTL-SDR devices, with a web
 interface for browsing received messages and changing receiver settings.
 .
 The SDRplay API is a vendor-provided prerequisite and must be installed
 separately before installing this package.
